[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24120.35, "timestamp": "06:42:00", "text": "这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24125.43, "timestamp": "06:42:05", "text": "今天。而且我也做了准备，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24127.67, "timestamp": "06:42:07", "text": "今天就用手持摄像机拍个视频吧。我买了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24130.11, "timestamp": "06:42:10", "text": "出去买了类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24134.23, "timestamp": "06:42:14", "text": "一块巧克力，和它一起吃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24138.27, "timestamp": "06:42:18", "text": "你们。所以我也会这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24142.868, "timestamp": "06:42:22", "text": "那。是啊，因为吃东西一点都不好玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24147.35, "timestamp": "06:42:27", "text": "只有巧克力，对吧？我想上次我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24149.19, "timestamp": "06:42:29", "text": "我也做过这件事，但我不是为了……而做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24154.23, "timestamp": "06:42:34", "text": "但我确实记得我做过一个手持摄像机拍摄的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24158.11, "timestamp": "06:42:38", "text": "我吃的那件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24160.548, "timestamp": "06:42:40", "text": "巧克力。是在直播中吗？还是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24162.59, "timestamp": "06:42:42", "text": "直播中断？我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24166.75, "timestamp": "06:42:46", "text": "记得，但那可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24177.51, "timestamp": "06:42:57", "text": "未来。让我再确认一下这东西是否真的存在。"}]